Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.75,0:23:14.66,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k23\blur5}Come {\k21}wit{\k22}ness {\k38}the {\k34}birth {\k41}of {\k24}the {\k24}great{\k20}est {\k19}lone{\k15}li{\k13}ness
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:18.33,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\k39\blur5}In {\k20}this {\k24}ho{\k23}llow {\k33}still{\k38}ness, {\k40}now {\k24}tell {\k22}me {\k18}what {\k19}will {\k24}you {\k17}choose?
